*'''Smack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Dragon Frontiers|Kirlia δ|33|Kirlia}} from the {{TCG|EX Dragon Frontiers}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

